 linux-2.6.x/arch/arm/mach-nds/dsiwifi.c      | 329 +++++++++++++++++++
 linux-2.6.x/arch/arm/mach-nds/volume.c       |  78 -----
 linux-2.6.x/drivers/block/dldi_c.c           |  31 ++
 vendors/Nintendo/DSI/wifi-dsi-test           |  18 +-
